{'symbol': 'CAT', 'date': '2021-12-08 11:00:00', 'title': 'CATERPILLAR INC. MAINTAINS DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DEERFIELD, ILL., DEC.\xa08, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CATERPILLAR INC. (NYSE: CAT) VOTED TODAY TO MAINTAIN THE QUARTERLY\xa0DIVIDEND\xa0OF\xa0ONE DOLLAR AND ELEVEN CENTS ($1.11) PER SHARE OF\xa0COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE FEBRUARY 18,\xa02022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT\xa0THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0JANUARY 20, 2022.'}